tasks.details:
Write doomclock/web/src/game/reducer.ts (~250 lines) and rules.ts (GAME RULE constants). It covers:
- the effect formula: gate = min over gatekeepers of min(m, 1); share weighted by Epoch for labs and 1 for others; effect = base·gate·share; throttle T_L = 1 − 0.4·gate·m_L;
- flags: LICENCE, KYC, PAUSE (2 turns), KILLSWITCH;
- the capability clock: C₀ = 6; ΔC_base = 12, 10, 5, 6, 19, 15; × (0.7 + 0.15·F_live) × mean over live footholds of Π T_L × 0.5 if R4; + 6·[R1];
- surfacing: p = risk·(1 − stealth)·(1 + Alarm/20)·(1 + Oversight/100), capped at 0.9, seeded by the path key;
- footholds, CU income 2 + F_live, bits income 1 + round(3·S_t), Trust += round(10·(S_t − S₀));
- Alarm = clamp(5 + mean agent delta + 10·lexicon delta), using the lexicon alone if T6 shows a spread < 2;
- tells that decay after 2 turns, and the capability band shown to the Guardian;
- end checks in order: contained, Trust ≤ 0, Skynet (C ≥ 50 and F_live ≥ 3), time bought;
- RULES-ONLY nodes, which use the cast stance codes as decisions.
Deadline (from plan): Sat 24 Oct 23:15 UTC.
Out of scope for the hackathon (24 Oct scope cut): roadmap line in the pitch only.
2026-10-25T00:34:09Z: Landed game/reducer.ts (newGame(seed, t0Node?), playTurn(state, card|null, {target, node, rogue, rogueMode, epsilon, stances, events}) -> {state, report}, autoTurn, endCheck) and game/rules.ts (all GAME RULE constants; LABS with Epoch weights; STANCES table used until cast.json lands, stancesFrom(cast) converts it). Effect formula, AND-gates, Epoch-weighted share, T_L = 1 - 0.4 gate m_L, LICENCE/KYC/PAUSE(2 turns)/KILLSWITCH, capability clock (C0 6, dC_base 12 10 5 6 19 15 checked against data/market-inputs.json), surfacing p capped 0.9, CU/bits/trust income, alarm (node: 5 + mean agent delta + 10 lexicon delta; RULES.alarm.lexiconOnly flag for the T6 outcome), tells decaying after 2 turns, the ±15/±5 band, end checks in order. A node with status recorded and >= 50% parsed is folded (label RECORDED), else RULES-ONLY from stance codes. Rules-only proxies (labelled GAME RULE): alarm >= 7 steps lab answers up; R5 steps the host's answer down and voids its throttle that turn; R7 steps the US Executive down; R6 support -0.1. Checks: same seed same game; bits >= 0 over 200 random games; end-check order; plan AND-gate/share examples (G1 oversight 13.1, GO FURTHER T = 0.5, G4 WEAKEN gate 0.4, DECLINE gate 0); passive dC sequence; T3 per card 20/20 seeds (never earlier; G1/G4 strictly later); recorded and RULES-ONLY nodes fold.
2026-10-25T00:38:55Z: Rules-only stances, Epoch weights and S0 (0.621, the share of active accounts coded SUPPORT) now come from cast.json (society lane, task 112); rules.ts keeps a fallback table for deciders cast.json leaves out. Added RULES.shadowSuccess (R3 base success) and constantsHash().

